  url     = {https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-024-07566-y},
  note    = {the primary source for model collapse},
  tldr    = {This Nature paper shows that indiscriminate recursive replacement with generated data can erase the tails of the original distribution and later cause broader degradation, a process the authors call model collapse.},
  tldr-zh = {这篇 Nature 论文表明，在递归生成的数据上不加甄别地训练生成模型，会不可逆地丢失原始分布的尾部，作者将这种退化过程命名为模型坍缩。}
}

